  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.704282,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这几天心里颇不宁静。",
      "output_sha256": "8a940c52ec403db0d68bf2d64b68f34afb0d021a9a9eb2f189f16b7b7b1a28f8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "8a940c52ec403db0d68bf2d64b68f34afb0d021a9a9eb2f189f16b7b7b1a28f8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今晚在院子里坐着乘凉，忽然想起日日走过的荷塘，在这满月的光里，总该另有一番样子吧。",
      "output_sha256": "c2099a13a8cc355ee92b4fc993bc215a1dda7ad8f6a12ad336f52c24f9881f3c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2099a13a8cc355ee92b4fc993bc215a1dda7ad8f6a12ad336f52c24f9881f3c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "月亮渐渐地升高了，墙外马路上孩子们的欢笑，已经听不见了；妻在屋里拍着闰儿，迷迷糊糊地哼着眠歌。",
      "output_sha256": "d56911871f01b1989c5e7e2e22863020b446d7a7f70dfd6ab22820bb0cb443ea",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "d56911871f01b1989c5e7e2e22863020b446d7a7f70dfd6ab22820bb0cb443ea",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我悄悄地披了大衫，带上门出去。",
      "output_sha256": "6d9ce148d4653567384dce6b9267f15700c34ab9c8b390149a661aa901bed7b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "6d9ce148d4653567384dce6b9267f15700c34ab9c8b390149a661aa901bed7b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "沿着荷塘，是一条曲折的小煤屑路。",
      "output_sha256": "1253bee94bad33232bd04111908c4fc6b17b3f9d5c9470db23999f735bac21f0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "1253bee94bad33232bd04111908c4fc6b17b3f9d5c9470db23999f735bac21f0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这是一条僻静的小道，白天人迹罕至，夜晚更是寂静。",
      "output_sha256": "f0be64619a7ce62e2c94be41a89681a47e2e6dab097622a7841e8b0f5f8ff59b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": 0.555387,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ea04e50d2599eb65c1c4cf213a8a5bf06768c52b8a46e0a734496165bb225012"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_ai_sha256": "f0be64619a7ce62e2c94be41a89681a47e2e6dab097622a7841e8b0f5f8ff59b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        6
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "荷塘周围长满了郁郁葱葱的树木，路边则是杨柳和几种不知名的树木。",
      "output_sha256": "83091776f58d122996b89b3d4a843bb4818aae39b35c869f0e99cbef745ba7b7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.47761,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7,
        8
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "cfff21b8d2ea614d2b54a377cb3f8e9f185343bea41801929e07338819da020b",
        "6ca79f7c0ace52b68119e3f6e37b9b0d644aaaf2c1fff5ce00ea12a9f1069009"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "83091776f58d122996b89b3d4a843bb4818aae39b35c869f0e99cbef745ba7b7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "没有月光的晚上，这路上阴森森的，有些怕人。",
      "output_sha256": "2d5ab897ccd9cc5ab2fa040520b73f6780f4b960ccfa4ebed6008d6daef6334a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "2d5ab897ccd9cc5ab2fa040520b73f6780f4b960ccfa4ebed6008d6daef6334a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "今晚却很好，虽然月光也还是淡淡的。",
      "output_sha256": "d2fd46bb3d0554aad0f10f758015bdbf27da2e01005d0d91996048b209dd9f94",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "d2fd46bb3d0554aad0f10f758015bdbf27da2e01005d0d91996048b209dd9f94",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "路上只我一个人，背着手踱着。",
      "output_sha256": "dd1df96bbb392bf33dce075d6c5304b8651d9ec1d6dada26e06c9958b8390f6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd1df96bbb392bf33dce075d6c5304b8651d9ec1d6dada26e06c9958b8390f6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这一片天地好像是我的；我也像超出了平常的自己，到了另一世界里。",
      "output_sha256": "b216b0ba6c9805edcc01fc0c27987dc03c3174e0a0a1dc6077e106eb59e6c51b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "b216b0ba6c9805edcc01fc0c27987dc03c3174e0a0a1dc6077e106eb59e6c51b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我爱热闹，也爱冷静；爱群居，也爱独处。",
      "output_sha256": "a5430c6dbce6ec903cb9d466e47c0ff48665a81aafa9d31af35d812ec5a936b0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "a5430c6dbce6ec903cb9d466e47c0ff48665a81aafa9d31af35d812ec5a936b0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "像今晚上，一个人在这苍茫的月下，什么都可以想，什么都可以不想，便觉是个自由的人。",
      "output_sha256": "82fadec81080e157195777b1510cedccba01cc9b54845d1fd814b355a1c68324",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "82fadec81080e157195777b1510cedccba01cc9b54845d1fd814b355a1c68324",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "白天必须完成的事情，白天必须说的话，此刻都不再重要。",
      "output_sha256": "59b45356c046aaaefc5ddad5ce5fc839c48c6321e6040f5bd3c2a6a7f516750b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.428063,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a5896daf11c61adfd0474b66138d44834b862752b99f6fe247a6cee77aab28cd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_ai_sha256": "59b45356c046aaaefc5ddad5ce5fc839c48c6321e6040f5bd3c2a6a7f516750b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这就是独处的妙处，我尽情享受着这无尽的荷香和月色。",
      "output_sha256": "2c61088562a7171e2762fd9ba53f71afc0dc5e9473dc56aca33e0dcaacd4f6c7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.628631,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "774433ac8ab5bc5bf8abc1cb1c725cc98af73fb2e08da7af65fd6b27ec1b0ed7"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2c61088562a7171e2762fd9ba53f71afc0dc5e9473dc56aca33e0dcaacd4f6c7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "荷塘上错落的荷叶，犹如一片片翩翩起舞的裙摆，出水的叶子高高挺立。",
      "output_sha256": "a36233b8dd997eb86708050766d075de894050abde56354b23d5d7a23df9178b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.365459,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17,
        18
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "eda6b7aeab0b9d1b3ca20ed5b79bb47cd4281b4fa3fb78bfacf39fd60cbb8530",
        "24e416ff3a70018527460616c17be8424f594937ec1cbed5ba0704bfa1bdd924"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "a36233b8dd997eb86708050766d075de894050abde56354b23d5d7a23df9178b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "层层的叶子中间，零星地点缀着些白花，有嬝娜地开着的，有羞涩地打着朶儿的；正如一粒粒的明珠，又如碧天里的星星，又如刚出浴的美人。",
      "output_sha256": "0c3fb6c49d9bdb3ce72c45df60375ce4a4cebaec1a3f1338595415a0e5110e5d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "0c3fb6c49d9bdb3ce72c45df60375ce4a4cebaec1a3f1338595415a0e5110e5d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "微风过处，送来缕缕清淸香，仿佛远处高楼上渺茫的歌声似的。",
      "output_sha256": "2622aef5b19f64db5c789fa370b743d5a3f5e57521a1c1543ae54a1e79159077",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "2622aef5b19f64db5c789fa370b743d5a3f5e57521a1c1543ae54a1e79159077",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "此时，荷叶与花瓣轻轻颤动，仿佛闪电般迅速传递至荷塘的另一端。",
      "output_sha256": "881e9405faea389e5bcab27dc6eebcea6ddf9cba8b01925c366626d1e56e4134",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.457635,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "afe46c3a51b4b12977bfca8a72fea7bc3b22c7e3bb016a8f52542caf31b044da"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_ai_sha256": "881e9405faea389e5bcab27dc6eebcea6ddf9cba8b01925c366626d1e56e4134",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        18
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "叶子本是紧密相贴，如今却形成了一道道波痕。",
      "output_sha256": "0d005ceb6f970e8aa3ceffcf2d32528959ca2f8f39233cd56647d8a596de6b31",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.431545,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "1ba78893e2f1a5f1416945d95ee3f55fdac8d88329d19ae1ea92f7e6db552f50"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0d005ceb6f970e8aa3ceffcf2d32528959ca2f8f39233cd56647d8a596de6b31",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "水流在叶子底下悄然流淌，颜色隐匿于其下，而叶子却愈发显得风韵独具。",
      "output_sha256": "13dd844f1fe1efed0560828cb9f22f32509297f9a3183c6ecdb0044a0ab5deb0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": 0.438119,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b8c482f3881e4c086b31106989745610eb2a4a09686992ffa731f5037fc7b4d6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "13dd844f1fe1efed0560828cb9f22f32509297f9a3183c6ecdb0044a0ab5deb0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "月光如流水般静静洒在叶子与花朵上，薄薄的青雾悄然升起，仿佛叶子与花朵刚刚在牛乳中洗过，或像披上轻纱的梦境。",
      "output_sha256": "98d669582f6bf47ef8b844992135b93d8b234f929012c9c6953090e58168cdc9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.569286,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24,
        25,
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d5c50b5227022939e560b469726c01f05a2834e54ee98a4cef4dfff53f27b16d",
        "60588f2532524e5eacb5a01b3b0e9636a7772780730b446d75ed20e97c9b2cf0",
        "b891e0db027eb16af1f96338d11ebef99ef19904988eeb00bf6a0e6a99388b32"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_ai_sha256": "98d669582f6bf47ef8b844992135b93d8b234f929012c9c6953090e58168cdc9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "虽然是满月，天上却有一层淡淡的云，所以不能朗照；但我以为这恰是到了好处——酣眠固不可少，小睡也别有风味的。",
      "output_sha256": "59b92eb6f9924253160509d56a6a017ccae5f4c5eaaa9e6c96bba6b1c53a629c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 27,
      "source_human_sha256": "59b92eb6f9924253160509d56a6a017ccae5f4c5eaaa9e6c96bba6b1c53a629c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "月光是隔了树照过来的，高处丛生的灌木，落下参差的斑驳的黑影，峭楞楞如鬼一般；弯弯的杨柳的稀疏的倩影，却又像是画在荷叶上。",
      "output_sha256": "fadddf8ba527e3b3a914c9953da08f5c388a63f81db86b69327197e958fe61aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "fadddf8ba527e3b3a914c9953da08f5c388a63f81db86b69327197e958fe61aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "塘中的月色并不均匀；但光与影有着和谐的旋律，如梵婀玲上奏着的名曲。",
      "output_sha256": "5feb5beedc80da7d7556107c8632f197a8c90f3d44f336c335046d9f67e8f254",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "5feb5beedc80da7d7556107c8632f197a8c90f3d44f336c335046d9f67e8f254",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "荷塘的四面，远远近近，高高低低都是树，而杨柳最多。",
      "output_sha256": "ae6a013833ac11cc799e068abcfd543baead1e2a83e32518194afb159c3f7de7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae6a013833ac11cc799e068abcfd543baead1e2a83e32518194afb159c3f7de7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这些树将一片荷塘重重围住；只在小路一旁，漏着几段空隙，像是特为月光留下的。",
      "output_sha256": "32be768cc3d7c7288ea9ec3ed808bce20b160bf99d9b9220b2e843a28d532164",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "32be768cc3d7c7288ea9ec3ed808bce20b160bf99d9b9220b2e843a28d532164",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "树色一例是阴阴的，乍看像一团烟雾；但杨柳的丰姿，便在烟雾里也辨得出。",
      "output_sha256": "dcd9e202a791f68eee1b08b243814d61fe556c37cfdcf197f7dfbe99796d34d4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "dcd9e202a791f68eee1b08b243814d61fe556c37cfdcf197f7dfbe99796d34d4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "树梢上隐隐约约的是一带远山，只有些大意罢了。",
      "output_sha256": "00b90c1d7827e26c114d3051a1cd894213fef798805a197c56490500c0f819b2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "00b90c1d7827e26c114d3051a1cd894213fef798805a197c56490500c0f819b2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "树间透出一两点路灯光，微弱得像是沉睡者的眼睛。",
      "output_sha256": "b2c60da576776052bf768e0fa067f9791dec16be2e984af220527fd9bc6aebab",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": 0.482609,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "054aecc28f3d1f49ae4255facf581d9356490b63dca799a5c805ccd8c564a45b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b2c60da576776052bf768e0fa067f9791dec16be2e984af220527fd9bc6aebab",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这时候最热闹的，要数树上的蝉声与水里的蛙声；但热闹是牠们的，我什么也没有。",
      "output_sha256": "5a174c11b8de82dd51c0aff678bd884f3a8080d830e3fecd1996478506baab28",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 35,
      "source_human_sha256": "5a174c11b8de82dd51c0aff678bd884f3a8080d830e3fecd1996478506baab28",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "忽然想起采莲的事情来了。",
      "output_sha256": "1ba8b0f36b1d9ee8cfe93f2feff9b4a61ae8693ad7c95f3fc965b6aa98e7e0e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "1ba8b0f36b1d9ee8cfe93f2feff9b4a61ae8693ad7c95f3fc965b6aa98e7e0e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "采莲是江南的传统习俗，似乎早在六朝时期就盛行，诗歌中可见一斑。",
      "output_sha256": "4f39d2093276b34e270ebf29cff3a1ca254c182df27f2c2e57b71ebd4a5b0934",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.540677,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bfe9b124ed8993ffdb2eb10dfab90b8c8cdfb5da6b9ec2d07c1411533cf65c30"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4f39d2093276b34e270ebf29cff3a1ca254c182df27f2c2e57b71ebd4a5b0934",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "采莲的是少年的女子，她们是荡着小船，唱着艳歌去的。",
      "output_sha256": "295322d98d38d8c952691966355d3b4bc4c1d7b2555e41e0aff0eccab1c5d9ef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "295322d98d38d8c952691966355d3b4bc4c1d7b2555e41e0aff0eccab1c5d9ef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "采莲的人不算多，还有围观的众人。",
      "output_sha256": "cc82c869ac3039a7bc6bb95c4caf3a212ef309881aee74c6515ed94f4da3fcad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.425805,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "19187dd1dd960cbbc1cf10faaa35b5ee87604e48d68fa032e37d059eb376cc43"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cc82c869ac3039a7bc6bb95c4caf3a212ef309881aee74c6515ed94f4da3fcad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        33
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "那是一个热闹而风情万种的季节。",
      "output_sha256": "497bf964ebad3d1c6cb8edcfeefe7121c47049fd5a9f7b058aead90f08ab6066",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": 0.544207,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "be1d0a35dbcba198201907d7177c88eeb4045bb8f8c717f55d8d850f676d8a66"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "497bf964ebad3d1c6cb8edcfeefe7121c47049fd5a9f7b058aead90f08ab6066",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "梁元帝采莲赋里说得好：",
      "output_sha256": "fcdef7efc5ac4737737d029a75650786f5c743ccc3233733a753b7e1ab8b8a21",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "fcdef7efc5ac4737737d029a75650786f5c743ccc3233733a753b7e1ab8b8a21",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是妖童媛女，荡舟心许；鹢首徐回，兼传羽杯；櫂将移而藻挂，船欲动而萍开。",
      "output_sha256": "2cc02bee99bba85d847abc84b0fdc3a21ca121b1e7a3ea8227b22664bc98450c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "2cc02bee99bba85d847abc84b0fdc3a21ca121b1e7a3ea8227b22664bc98450c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "尔其纤腰束素，迁延顾步；夏始春余，叶嫩花初，恐沾裳而浅笑，畏倾船而敛裾。",
      "output_sha256": "3244e5f0af652e0d7467b4b366e354b15a63f6ad835d68e06a5f7d6ea4088f82",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 43,
      "source_human_sha256": "3244e5f0af652e0d7467b4b366e354b15a63f6ad835d68e06a5f7d6ea4088f82",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可见当时嬉游的光景了。",
      "output_sha256": "7a63080a7534d14cc2b57158048ce397f13ea3c0c4aabdd1d56a75bbdce5021b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "7a63080a7534d14cc2b57158048ce397f13ea3c0c4aabdd1d56a75bbdce5021b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "这真是有趣的往事，可惜我们如今已无缘体验。",
      "output_sha256": "eb01faffb91fcb86f4e92fccefa7b709380fff95f0d1d1bf97597c37d417a60a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.626111,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6303f15dbf2c211123b49d86e1b7b9d7231512872b03d41dac2cde9ef3697fbb"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "eb01faffb91fcb86f4e92fccefa7b709380fff95f0d1d1bf97597c37d417a60a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "于是又记起西洲曲里的句子：",
      "output_sha256": "91fdab759383de6901fcf598d37628490aa7592c516bac44c2267d34b5334445",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "91fdab759383de6901fcf598d37628490aa7592c516bac44c2267d34b5334445",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "采莲南塘秋，莲花过人头；低头弄莲子，莲子淸如水。",
      "output_sha256": "6a0a2f22a565eea11f02ead271a6b5d2b591bfc3430e69155d1875409a64a30b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "6a0a2f22a565eea11f02ead271a6b5d2b591bfc3430e69155d1875409a64a30b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "今晚若有采莲人，这里的莲花也算得“过人头”了；只是不见任何流水的影子，似乎有些遗憾。",
      "output_sha256": "7e0a15071a0125f8e5cd7dc2f09b10dbfc65b9a866bb3a884f2de4e306b6d8d1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": 0.704282,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "20db247cd35ab6049033e358dcf09459509dec9ec09c452e4ba0d715ec8f5aa4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7e0a15071a0125f8e5cd7dc2f09b10dbfc65b9a866bb3a884f2de4e306b6d8d1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "这令我到底惦着江南了。",
      "output_sha256": "5eb709ab63d8a4f03f57d5080dc58a5d27199a482ed92bc198611580669a6156",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "5eb709ab63d8a4f03f57d5080dc58a5d27199a482ed92bc198611580669a6156",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "——这样想着，猛一抬头，不觉已是自己的门前；轻轻地推门进去，什么声息也没有，妻已睡熟好久了。",
      "output_sha256": "370578e266198f69585dd76c48015ec784faf0c18bc9bb4cd03a360cab7a639e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "370578e266198f69585dd76c48015ec784faf0c18bc9bb4cd03a360cab7a639e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
